{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22463","headline":"我身 · 白居易","name":"我身","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"我身何所似，似彼孤生蓬。\n秋霜翦根断，浩浩随长风。\n昔游秦雍间，今落巴蛮中。\n昔爲意气郎，今作寂寥翁。\n外貌虽寂莫，中怀颇冲融。\n赋命有厚薄，委心任穷通。\n通当爲大鹏，举翅摩苍穹。\n穷则爲鹪鹩，一枝足自容。\n苟知此道者，身穷心不穷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22463.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22463","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}